  "body": "**Link to problem area**: Yes\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nThe spec uses RFC 2119, but doesn't document that. I would expect based on [Travis' statement](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/issues/1782#issuecomment-2284286870) that fixing this would be a clarification and thus not require the MSC process.\r\n\r\nhttps://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2119",
